# Local working material: the old-site crawl, full-resolution photo originals,
# the source spreadsheets (every faculty email address), notes and drafts.
# Root-anchored on purpose: a bare "*.md" would also match _faculty/, _news/,
# _pages/ and every layout. Most of these are also listed under `exclude:` in
# _config.yml, which keeps them out of the built site if they are present.
/.crawl/
/.images/
/.fonts/
/*.csv
/CLAUDE.md
/HANDOFF.md
/TOOLS.md
/AUDIT-*.md
/ADMIN-GUIDE.md
/CLAUDE-CODE-BRIEF.md
/REBUILD-PROMPT.md
/build_faculty_directory.md
/tpcb_landing_example.html
